{"success":true,"message":"Blogs retrieved successfully","data":[{"id":119,"slug":"holistic-education-lucknow","date":"2026-09-24","last_updated_by":"10050","visibility":"publish","created_at":"2026-09-24T11:50:54.953000Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T11:50:55.683000Z","branch_id":"2","school_id":"1","image_url":"https:\/\/myschool-assets.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com\/dps\/blogs_images\/cNreG7aTCdkPukDKptDnEx84XgAakvULsDFby1Vp.webp","meta_title":"Holistic Education vs Marks: A New Approach in Lucknow","meta_description":"Discover why holistic education matters beyond marks and how schools in Lucknow are redefining success through skills, confidence, creativity, and growth.","image_alt":null,"main_title":"Holistic Education vs Marks: A New Approach in Lucknow","main_description":"Discover why holistic education matters beyond marks and how schools in Lucknow are redefining success through skills, confidence, creativity, and growth.","school":{"id":1,"name":"Delhi Public School","description":"Delhi Public School","logo":"","website":"","email":"","phone":"","address":"","city":"","state":"","country":"","postal_code":"","principal_name":"","principal_email":"","principal_phone":"","established_year":null,"accreditation":"","mission":"","vision":"","core_values":"","status":"active","meta_title":"","meta_description":"","meta_keywords":"","language":null,"language_id":"1","created_at":"2025-08-07T20:31:54.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T17:21:25.200000Z","slug":"delhi-public-scool"},"branch":{"id":2,"name":"Eldeco","description":"Dps Eldeco","branch_code":"","address":"Sector II, Raksha khand Udhyan II,Eldeco Colony,\r\nRai Barelly Road","city":"Distt Lucknow","state":"Uttar Pradesh","country":"","postal_code":"226025","phone":"+91 5224081945 ,  +91 7522002115","email":"contact@dpseldeco.com","website":"","branch_head_name":"","branch_head_email":"","branch_head_phone":"","capacity":0,"current_students":0,"facilities":"","special_features":"","status":"active","meta_title":"Test Branch - Meta Title","meta_description":"Test branch meta description","meta_keywords":"test, branch, school","language":null,"language_id":"1","school_id":"1","created_at":"2025-08-28T05:14:01.467000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-12T11:16:24.683000Z","slug":"test-branch-2025-08-28-104401","logo":""},"blogdetails":[{"id":365,"title":"Why Holistic Education is More Important Than Marks: How Schools in Lucknow are redefining success","description":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-532600d8-7fff-eda5-2a7a-fb52793258be\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Every parent wants their child to succeed. But what does success actually mean today? This blog covers why holistic education matters more than marks and how DPS Eldeco, as one of the leading <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">schools in Lucknow<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, is redefining what a good education actually produces.<\/span><\/font><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Introduction<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Let me tell you about two students. Both scored above 90% in Class 12. Both got into decent colleges. Both had parents who were proud and relieved in equal measure. Five years later, one of them is doing well. They adapted to university quickly. They built relationships. When something went wrong at work, they handled it without falling apart. They figured out new problems in fields they had never studied before. The other one is struggling. Not with intelligence but with everything else. The pressure of an unstructured environment. The complexity of working with people who think differently. The specific difficulty of a challenge that has no answer at the back of the textbook. This is the predictable result of two different kinds of education. One that measured success by scores. One that built the whole person.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">DPS Eldeco was established in 2000 with a clear understanding of which kind of education actually matters. As one of the <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/\" target=\"_self\">schools in Lucknow<\/a><\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> that has consistently invested in holistic development alongside academic rigour, it has spent over two decades proving that marks and wholeness are not competing priorities. They are the same priority, pursued seriously.<\/span><\/font><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">What Holistic Education Is and What It Is Not<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Before getting into the reasons why holistic education matters more than marks, it is worth being precise about what the phrase actually means. Because it gets used a lot and defined rarely.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Holistic education is not the absence of academic rigour. It is not the idea that marks do not matter or that examinations should be abolished. It is not about making school easier or more relaxed.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">It is the recognition that a child is not just a student. They are an intellectual, emotional, social, physical and moral being. And an education that only addresses the student (the part that answers examination papers) leaves most of the person undeveloped. Holistic education develops the whole person:&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The thinking<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The feeling<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The relating<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The creating<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The leading<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The serving<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">And the research is clear that this complete development is what produces success in adult life, more consistently and more durably than examination scores alone. DPS Eldeco has built its educational approach around this understanding. Here is why it matters.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">5 Reasons Why Holistic Education at Schools in Lucknow Matters More Than Marks<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">If marks were everything, then every life event would have asked us to show our report cards. But that never happens! So, here\u2019s why overall development is necessary:&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">1. Holistic Education Builds the Life Skills That Marks Cannot Measure<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Yes. And this is the gap that most parents only discover after their child has left school. Examinations measure recall, accuracy and familiarity with a specific format. They do not measure the ability to communicate an idea clearly to someone who does not already agree with it. They do not measure the ability to work productively with people who think differently. They do not measure critical thinking applied to a problem nobody has seen before.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">These capabilities (communication, teamwork, adaptability and structured reasoning) applied to novel challenges are what the modern workforce consistently identifies as both most valued. Yet, these are the most underdeveloped in new graduates. At DPS Eldeco, life skills are built into the school's co-curricular structure, its classroom culture and the specific way subjects are taught.<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Communication skills developed through debate, presentation and structured discussion embedded across subjects<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Teamwork practised through genuine group challenges rather than simulated exercises<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Critical thinking built into how subjects are assessed, not confined to one-off problem-solving activities<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Adaptability developed through exposure to unfamiliar challenges in extracurricular and academic contexts<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">2. Emotional Intelligence is More Predictive of Success Than Academic Performance<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Daniel Goleman's research made this point three decades ago and the evidence has only strengthened since. Emotional intelligence (the ability to understand and manage your own emotional state and to engage effectively with the emotional states of others) is a stronger predictor of professional success, relationship quality and life satisfaction than IQ or academic performance. And it is built during childhood and adolescence. Primarily through the environments children inhabit. Which means the school that takes emotional development seriously is investing in one of the most consequential capabilities a person will ever have.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">High marks do not build emotional resilience. Sitting with a difficult situation, receiving feedback that stings, losing something you worked hard for, managing anxiety before a performance are the experiences that build emotional resilience. At schools in Lucknow, emotional wellbeing is a school-wide priority, embedded in teacher-student relationships, in the co-curricular structure and in the specific way the school handles difficulty when it arrives.<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Trained counsellors accessible proactively, not only in crisis situations<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">School culture that normalises difficulty and models healthy responses to setbacks<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Co-curricular experiences (sport, performance, leadership) providing the real emotional challenges that build genuine resilience<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Social and emotional learning embedded in daily school life rather than confined to a single programme<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">3. Real-World Application in Education Develops Lifelong Learners<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Often, you will find a child wondering, \u201cWhy am I learning this?\u201d. \u201cDoes geography, algebra, or history really impact my life?\u201d When the answer is, \u201cSo you can answer a question about it in an examination.\u201d motivation is borrowed against a future payoff that many students cannot fully imagine. On the other hand, when it is, \u201c Because this connects to something real, something you can see and touch and use.\u201d motivation comes from within and sustains itself.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Holistic education at schools in Lucknow makes this connection explicit. It links academic content to practical experience. At DPS Eldeco, this connection is built into how the curriculum is delivered. Experiential learning, hands-on activities and real-world application are how subjects are regularly taught. The result is students who understand why they are learning, which is the foundation of the most valuable educational outcome of all: the ability and the desire to keep learning long after school ends.<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Experiential learning connecting academic concepts to real-world contexts regularly and deliberately<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Field trips and outbound activities extending learning beyond the classroom into lived experience<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Project-based assignments requiring students to apply knowledge across disciplines simultaneously<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">A school culture that rewards curiosity and questioning, developing the intrinsic motivation that sustains lifelong learning<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">4. Character Building Matters More Than Academic Achievement in the Long Run<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">This is the one most easily dismissed as soft. And it is the one that turns out to matter most in the long run. Integrity. Empathy. Responsibility. The ability to act with decency when it would be easier not to. The willingness to take accountability for a mistake rather than explain it away. The genuine care for people beyond your immediate circle. These are not personality traits people are born with or without. They are shaped slowly, through the environments children inhabit, the values modelled by the adults around them and the experiences that test character and reveal what is actually there. And this starts right from primary school in Lucknow.&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">DPS Eldeco integrates values into its school culture from the very initial classes. We do it through community service, arts and the consistent example of a faculty that models the values it espouses. Character at this school is not a programme. It is the air the institution breathes.<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Community service embedding civic responsibility as a lived value rather than a scheduled activity<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Arts, music and physical education developing the compassion, creativity and discipline that build character alongside capability<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Faculty modelling integrity, empathy and intellectual honesty in daily interaction with students<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">A school culture where how you treat people matters as much as how you perform academically<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">5. Physical Development Through Sports and Activities Affect Academic and Professional Success<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">This connection is the most counterintuitive to parents under examination pressure. And it is one of the most thoroughly documented in educational research. Physical activity improves cognitive function. This is not a motivational claim. It is neuroscience. Regular physical exercise increases blood flow to the brain, improves concentration and memory consolidation, reduces anxiety and builds the emotional regulation that directly supports academic performance.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Beyond the neurological benefits, sport builds the specific character that professional life rewards most reliably. At DPS Eldeco, sports are treated as a genuine developmental priority with proper infrastructure, competitive opportunity and the understanding that a physically developed student is also, consistently, a more capable academic one.<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Structured sports programme with proper coaching and genuine competitive exposure across multiple disciplines<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Physical development connected explicitly to the emotional regulation and concentration that academic performance requires<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Sports culture built around developing character alongside physical skill: sportsmanship, discipline and resilience as expected outcomes<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Regular physical activity integrated into school life in ways that support wellbeing and cognitive function simultaneously<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Conclusion<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Marks are not the enemy. They are a measure\u2013 a useful one. But a partial one. The students who do best in adult life (who navigate complexity, build meaningful relationships, recover from difficulty, lead when leadership is needed and contribute something genuine to the world) are the ones who were educated completely, not just academically.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/\" target=\"_self\">schools in Lucknow<\/a><\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> that understand this are the ones producing those graduates. DPS Eldeco is one of them. Over two decades of consistent investment in both academic excellence and holistic development have produced something that marks alone never could: a school full of smart people, ready for the full complexity of what follows school.<\/span><\/font><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Visit DPS Eldeco to see holistic education in action.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Your Queries Answered<\/font><\/span><\/h2><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Why Is Holistic Education at Schools in Lucknow Important for a Child's Future Success?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Holistic education helps students develop communication, resilience, teamwork, leadership, creativity and problem-solving skills alongside academics. These life skills play a major role in long-term personal and professional success.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Does Focusing on Holistic Development Affect Board Exam Performance?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">No. Holistic development often strengthens academic performance by improving focus, discipline, motivation, confidence and stress management. These qualities help students perform better both inside and outside the classroom.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">How Does DPS Eldeco Implement Holistic Education Alongside Strong Academics?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">DPS Eldeco combines strong CBSE academics with sports, performing arts, leadership programmes, community service, career guidance and student wellbeing initiatives to support all-round development.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">What Is the Admission Process for DPS Eldeco?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The admission process generally includes an inquiry, campus visit, application submission, document verification and interaction with the admissions team. Parents are encouraged to visit the school during regular working hours to experience the learning environment firsthand.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">How Do Schools in Lucknow Develop Emotional Intelligence in Students?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Through counselling support, social-emotional learning, leadership opportunities, sports and co-curricular activities, schools help students build self-awareness, resilience, empathy and confidence.<\/font><\/span><\/p><font face=\"Georgia\">Read More :<\/font><a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/blog\/cbse-schools-lucknow-class-11-admission\" target=\"_self\">Best CBSE Schools in Lucknow for Class 11 Admission in Science, Commerce and Humanities<\/a><span style=\"font-size: small; color: rgb(43, 60, 107); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-weight: 600;\"><\/span><p class=\"w-[90%] text-[#70747F] text-[20px] mt-2\" style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 \/ 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ;