t;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Science rewards consistency. Not last-minute heroics.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Choose Commerce If\u2026<\/font><\/span><\/h3><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Numbers make sense to them beyond exam marks<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">They enjoy business, economics, finance or practical problem-solving<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">They are considering CA, CS, BBA, Economics, Finance or entrepreneurship<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">They like analysing how money moves and why companies work<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Commerce today is far bigger than \u201caccounts stream.\u201d It opens doors into finance, consulting, analytics, startups and management careers.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Choose Humanities If\u2026<\/font><\/span><\/h3><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">They are curious about people, society, politics, psychology or media<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">They enjoy writing, discussion and analytical thinking<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">They are considering law, design, journalism, UPSC, psychology or liberal arts<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">They ask \u201cwhy\u201d more than \u201cwhat comes in exam?\u201d<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Humanities is no longer the \u201cbackup stream.\u201d Top universities are seeing massive demand for Humanities combinations and interdisciplinary careers.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">One More Important Thing<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Do not choose a stream based on relatives who still think it is 2009. Choose based on:<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">aptitude<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">interest<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">consistency<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">mental bandwidth<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">career direction<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">and the kind of pressure your child actually handles well<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Because two years in the wrong stream can feel very long. And two years in the right one can completely change confidence, performance and career direction.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Conclusion<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/\" target=\"_self\">best CBSE schools in Lucknow<\/a><\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> for Class 11 are not necessarily the ones with the biggest name boards outside the gate. They are the ones that match your child\u2019s learning style, career direction and chosen stream properly. Every school listed above brings something different to the table. Some are stronger for a competitive exam culture. Some offer better flexibility. Some thrive on discipline and structure. So visit the campuses you are seriously considering.<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br><\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Ask useful questions.<\/span><\/font><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Which faculty teaches the core subjects?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">What subject combinations are actually available?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">How do students from that stream perform in boards and entrance exams?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">What support exists for students who struggle midway through Class 11?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Is the environment motivating or just academically loud?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Because brochures can say many things and classrooms usually say the truth faster. And in the end, the \u201cbest school\u201d is simply the one where your child is most likely to grow, stay confident and do well for the next two very important years.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Your Queries Answered<\/font><\/span><\/h2><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">1. Which are the best CBSE schools in Lucknow for Class 11 Science stream?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><b>Ans -<\/b> DPS Eldeco, Allenhouse Vrindavan Yojna, Seth Anandram Jaipuria School, Army Public School and Lucknow Public School are among the top CBSE schools in Lucknow for Science stream admissions. Most offer both PCM and PCB combinations along with competitive exam preparation support for JEE and NEET aspirants.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">2. What are the admission criteria for Class 11 in reputed CBSE schools in Lucknow?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia;\"><b>Ans -<\/b> <\/span><font face=\"Georgia\">Most schools consider Class 10 board marks along with an entrance test or counselling interaction. Some schools also set minimum percentage requirements for Science and Commerce streams. Admission criteria vary every year, so parents should check directly with the school after board results are announced.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">3. Which school is best for Class 11 Commerce admission in Lucknow?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia;\"><b>Ans - <\/b><\/span><font face=\"Georgia\">Schools like Seth Anandram Jaipuria, Army Public School, DPS Eldeco and Lucknow Public School are strong options for Commerce. Parents should compare faculty quality, CUET preparation support, career guidance and subject combinations instead of choosing only by reputation.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">4. Should students change schools after Class 10 or continue in the same school?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia;\"><b>Ans - <\/b><\/span><font face=\"Georgia\">Students should change schools only if another school offers clearly better faculty, stronger academic support, better stream options or entrance preparation. If the current school provides a good learning environment and the preferred stream, continuing is the more beneficial option.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">5. What documents are required for Class 11 admission in Lucknow schools?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia;\"><b>Ans -<\/b> <\/span><font face=\"Georgia\">Most CBSE schools in Lucknow require the Class 10 marksheet, Transfer Certificate, passport-size photographs, Aadhaar card, date of birth proof and character certificate. Some schools may also ask for entrance test documents, migration certificates or previous school records.<\/font><\/span><\/p><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Read More : <\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(43, 60, 107); font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-weight: 600;\"><font size=\"3\"><a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/blog\/cbse-school-lucknow-skill-development\" target=\"_self\">Why the Best CBSE Board School in Lucknow Prioritizes Skill Development<\/a><\/font><\/span><\/div><\/span><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><br><\/div><p class=\"w-[90%] text-[#70747F] text-[20px] mt-2\" style=\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-gradient-from-position: ; --tw-gradient-via-position: ; --tw-gradient-to-position: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgb(59 130 246 \/ 0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; --tw-contain-size: ; --tw-contain-layout: ; --tw-contain-paint: ; --tw-contain-style: ; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); margin: 0.5rem 0px 0px; width: 1137.6px; font-size: 20px; --tw-text-opacity: 1; color: rgb(112, 116, 127); font-family: ui-sans-serif, syste