height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">An <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/\" target=\"_self\">English medium school in Lucknow<\/a><\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> like DPS Eldeco takes this seriously. English fluency here isn't just about language, it's about the ability to think clearly and express those thoughts in a way that other people can actually receive.<\/span><\/font><\/p><ul style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">English immersion environments build fluency that goes beyond grammar and vocabulary<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font fac