mwork Is Harder Than It Looks and More Important Than Most Subjects<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Nobody tells you this as a child. Teamwork sounds simple. Work together, share the load, be nice to each other. Easy enough.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Then you're 28 years old in a meeting with five people who all have different opinions, different working styles, and different ideas about what success looks like. And suddenly it's the hardest thing in the room.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The children who handle that well aren't the ones who read about collaboration. They're the ones who actually did it \u2014 repeatedly, in environments where it mattered, where there were real stakes and real disagreements and they had to figure it out anyway.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">best CBSE Board school in Lucknow<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> builds these experiences in. Group projects, sports teams, cultural events, community initiatives aren't just activities, they're practice for a skill that will follow a child into every professional environment they ever inhabit.<\/span><\/font><\/p><ul style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Team-based learning develops the ability to collaborate with people you didn't choose<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Sports build the specific kind of teamwork that involves pressure, competition, and shared accountability<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><