align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">A child entering the workforce in the next decade who isn't comfortable with technology isn't behind. They're invisible. This isn't about teaching children to use phones, they already know how to do that better than most adults. It's about teaching them to use technology purposefully. To code, to analyse data, to build things digitally, to understand how the systems shaping their world actually work.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">A <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">top rated school in Lucknow<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> that integrates technology into learning (not as a subject, but as a tool across subjects) produces graduates who are genuinely ready for a digital-first world.<\/span><\/font><\/p><ul style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Coding and computational thinking develop structured, logical problem-solving<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type