eatures":"","status":"active","meta_title":"Test Branch - Meta Title","meta_description":"Test branch meta description","meta_keywords":"test, branch, school","language":null,"language_id":"1","school_id":"1","created_at":"2025-08-28T05:14:01.467000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-12T11:16:24.683000Z","slug":"test-branch-2025-08-28-104401","logo":""},"blogdetails":[{"id":266,"title":"How an English Medium School in Lucknow Integrates Coding into the Curriculum","description":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1b72cdfe-7fff-07fb-6bfb-918c72debbdb\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">An <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">English medium school in Lucknow<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> aims for smart, future-ready prep. In this process, they now integrate coding into everyday learning through robotics labs, AI clubs, gaming logic and app-building projects. Let us look into how coding is introduced across grades and why it matters.<\/span><\/font><\/p><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-fd453735-7fff-3933-53a8-59d4201257c3\" style=\"\"><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Introduction<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Eight-year-old Aarav was not writing an essay in class. He was building a simple game where a rocket avoided asteroids. Across the corridor, middle-school students were programming sensors. They were engrossed in a project that had to measure rainfall. Intriguing, right? Yes, this is what classrooms are beginning to look like in a modern <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/\" target=\"_self\">English medium school in Lucknow<\/a><\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">. Coding has jumped from being a niche technical skill meant only for future engineers to primary school classes. Schools now see it as a language of logic, creativity and problem-solving. Parents, too, are asking sharper questions during admissions. Does the school teach coding early? Are students learning AI tools responsibly? Is technology integrated into subjects or taught separately? And rightly so! Here below we will explain how coding is becoming part of mainstream school education.<\/span><\/font><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Why Coding Is Becoming Essential in School Education<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">A modern <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">English Medium School in Lucknow<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> introduces coding because the future workplace will demand digital thinking across industries. Students may become doctors or architects, designers or entrepreneurs but logical reasoning and technology literacy will still matter in their careers.<\/span><\/font><\/p><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1cba1c2d-7fff-cf43-b633-92de109b4008\" style=\"\"><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Coding helps students develop:<\/font><\/span><\/h3><ul style=\"font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Problem-solving skills<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Logical thinking<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Creativity through digital projects<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Collaboration and teamwork<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Confidence with technology<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Better understanding of AI and automation<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">What coding teaches beyond computers<\/font><\/span><\/h3><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;\" align=\"left\" bis_skin_checked=\"1\"><table style=\"border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\"><colgroup><col width=\"121\"><col width=\"281\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:25pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.5pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: center;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Skill<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/td><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.5pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\