;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Sequencing games and visual logic<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"height:25pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.5pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Classes 3\u20135<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/td><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.5pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Basic animation and storytelling<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr style=\"height:25pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.5pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Classes 5\u20136<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/td><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.5pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Introductory robotics and app logic<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">At DPS Eldeco, we integrate coding from junior classes by introducing computational thinking through hands-on, play-based learning and gradually progressing to text-based languages like Python and JavaScript. We combine coding with art and storytelling. A child may design a digital comic strip while learning programming commands in the background. That makes learning less intimidating and more engaging.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">How a CBSE School in Lucknow Integrates Coding Across Subjects<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">A <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">CBSE school in Lucknow<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> does not isolate coding inside one computer lab. Instead, technology becomes part of multiple subjects. Students begin applying coding concepts in science experiments, mathematics projects, geography simulations and even language presentations.<\/span><\/font><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">This interdisciplinary model makes coding practical instead of theoretical.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">E<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">xamples of subject integration<\/span><\/font><\/h3><ul style=\"font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Science students create weather-monitoring projects<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Maths classes use coding to understand graphs and patterns<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Geography projects include digital map-building<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">English presentations use animation tools<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vert