>Technology integration should feel meaningful, not promotional.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Questions parents can ask schools<\/font><\/span><\/h3><ul style=\"font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">At what grade does coding begin?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Is coding integrated into subjects?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Are robotics and STEM clubs available?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">How are teachers trained?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Does the school conduct coding competitions?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">How is screen time managed?<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><div bis_skin_checked=\"1\" style=\"\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-5abc3d5f-7fff-0546-4b96-1635a544471d\" style=\"\"><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal