sparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Contact admissions for full details<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/th><\/tr><tr style=\"height:33.75pt\"><th style=\"border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.5pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 6pt 5pt 8pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\" scope=\"col\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Competitive Exam Prep<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/th><th style=\"border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.5pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 6pt 5pt 8pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\" scope=\"col\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">CBSE-NCERT aligned JEE \/ NEET \/ CUET foundation built from Day 1<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/th><\/tr><\/thead><\/table><\/div><\/span><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">\r\n<\/font><\/span><\/h2><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Conclusion<\/font><\/span><\/h2><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-d59f8700-7fff-3feb-d08c-95477c42ce39\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Early learners need a school that understands how children learn and designs every experience around that understanding. The <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; font-weight: normal;\">CBSE curriculum benefits<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> we've described are concrete, measurable outcomes of a well-taught CBSE programme delivered with genuine commitment.<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At DPS Eldeco, we build that foundation every day. For every early learner who walks through our doors, we make sure they get the best. If you are looking for the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/\" target=\"_self\" style=\"\"><b>best CBSE school in Lucknow<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for your child's most formative years, we'd love to show you what that looks like in practice. Visit our campus. Meet our teachers. Watch a class in session.<\/span><\/span><\/p><\/font><\/span><\/span><\/h2><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Frequently Asked Questions<\/font><\/span><\/h2><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><h3 style=\"font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">What are the main CBSE curriculum benefits for early learners?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">CBSE focuses on understanding, not memorising. Kids learn <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">why<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> things work. English develops naturally across subjects. The curriculum stays balanced with science, language, arts, and activities. And if families relocate, the CBSE system makes school transitions smoother.<\/span><\/font><\/p><h3 style=\"font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Which is the best CBSE school in Lucknow for early learners?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Many parents consider <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-weight: normal;\">DPS Eldeco, Lucknow<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> a strong option. It follows CBSE standards with a concept-based early learning approach. Children build English skills, basic numeracy, and curiosity early on. Academics and emotional well-being both get attention.<\/span><\/font><\/p><h3 style=\"font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">What is the admission fee structure at DPS Eldeco Lucknow?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Fees are shared clearly by the admissions team. They usually include tuition, development charges, and activity fees. The exact amount depends on the grade. For the latest details, it\u2019s best to contact the school or visit the campus.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 style=\"font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">At what age should I enrol my child in a CBSE school in Lucknow?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Most CBSE schools accept children around <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-weight: normal;\">2.5 to 3 years<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> for Pre-Nursery or Nursery. At this age, learning happens through play, stories, and simple activities. Starting early helps children build language, confidence, and basic thinking skills.<\/span><\/font><\/p><h3 style=\"font-weight: normal; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">How does DPS Eldeco prepare early learners for competitive exams?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The focus isn\u2019t exam drilling. It\u2019s building strong basics. Children develop logical thinking, reading skills, and curiosity. These abilities later help in exams like <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; font-weight: normal;\">JEE, NEET, or CUET<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">. The idea is simple: understand first, prepare later.<\/span><\/font><\/p><div style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br><\/span><\/div><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\"><\/font><\/span><\/h2><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/span><\/div><\/span>","image_url":"https:\/\/myschool-assets.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com\/dps\/blogs_images\/1778669372_Benefits_of_CBSE_Curriculum_for_Early_Learners_in_Lucknow.webp","image_alt_text":"best CBSE school in Lucknow","last_updated_by":"10050","created_at":"2026-05-13T10:49:33.617000Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T10:49:33.617000Z","blog_id":"57","branch_id":"2","school_id":"1","section_order":"1"}],"categories":[],"tag":[{"id":39,"name":"DPS primary school","description":null,"status":"active","publish_status":"published","sort_order":1,"color":"#667eea","school_id":"1","branch_id":"5","language_id":null,"created_at":"2026-03-14T10:43:03.977000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T05:37:54.833000Z","slug":"DPS primary school","pivot":{"blog_id":"57","tag_id":"39"}},{"id":49,"name":"CBSE Board Benefits","description":null,"status":"active","publish_status":"published","sort_order":0,"color":"#667eea","school_id":"1","branch_id":"9","language_id":null,"created_at":"2026-03-27T05:26:46.570000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T05:26:46.570000Z","slug":"cbse-vs-icse","pivot":{"blog_id":"57","tag_id":"49"}},{"id":52,"name":"Academic Success for Students","description":null,"status":"active","publish_status":"published","sort_order":0,"color":"#667eea","school_id":"1","branch_id":"9","language_id":null,"created_at":"2026-04-02T05:02:28.147000Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T05:02:28.147000Z","slug":"academic-success-for-students","pivot":{"blog_id":"57","tag_id":"52"}},{"id":62,"name":"CBSE School Admission 2026","description":null,"status":"active","publish_status":"published","sort_order":0,"color":"#667eea","school_id":"1","branch_id":"8","language_id":null,"created_at":"2026-04-07T07:23:46.897000Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T07:23:46.897000Z","slug":"cbse-school-admission-2026","pivot":{"blog_id":"57","tag_id":"62"}}]},{"id":54,"slug":"mental-health-cbse-schools-emotional-wellbeing","date":"2026-04-13","last_updated_by":"10050","visibility":"publish","created_at":"2026-04-13T11:55:38.637000Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T11:19:49.553000Z","branch_id":"2","school_id":"1","image_url":"https:\/\/myschool-assets.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com\/dps\/blogs_images\/1776683988_Mental_Health_in_CBSE_Schools_Why_Emotional_Well-Being_Matters_for_Students.webp","meta_title":"Mental Health in CBSE Schools: Why It Matters","meta_description":"Discover why mental health matters in CBSE schools and how emotional well-being impacts student success, learning, and overall development.","image_alt":null,"main_title":"Mental Health in CBSE Schools: Why It Matters","main_description":"Discover why mental health matters in CBSE schools and how emotional well-being impacts student success, learning, and overall development.","school":{"id":1,"name":"Delhi Public School","description":"Delhi Public School","logo":"","website":"","email":"","phone":"","address":"","city":"","state":"","country":"","postal_code":"","principal_name":"","principal_email":"","principal_phone":"","established_year":null,"accreditation":"","mission":"","vision":"","core_values":"","status":"active","meta_title":"","meta_description":"","meta_keywords":"","language":null,"language_id":"1","created_at":"2025-08-07T20:31:54.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T17:21:25.200000Z","slug":"delhi-public-scool"},"branch":{"id":2,"name":"Eldeco","description":"Dps Eldeco","branch_code":"","address":"Sector II, Raksha khand Udhyan II,Eldeco Colony,\r\nRai Barelly Road","city":"Distt Lucknow","state":"Uttar Pradesh","country":"","postal_code":"226025","phone":"+91 5224081945 ,  +91 7522002115","email":"contact@dpseldeco.com","website":"","branch_head_name":"","branch_head_email":"","branch_head_phone":"","capacity":0,"current_students":0,"facilities":"","special_features":"","status":"active","meta_title":"Test Branch - Meta Title","meta_description":"Test branch meta description","meta_keywords":"test, branch, school","language":null,"language_id":"1","school_id":"1","created_at":"2025-08-28T05:14:01.467000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-12T11:16:24.683000Z","slug":"test-branch-2025-08-28-104401","logo":""},"blogdetails":[{"id":220,"title":"Mental Health in CBSE Schools: Why Emotional Well-Being Matters for Students","description":"<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-04235702-7fff-ab2f-bb7b-7998f312329f\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Research published on PMC shows that over 74% of students in schools experience high academic stress. This article explores why <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">emotional well-being<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">is the missing half of academic excellence and how DPS Eldeco, Lucknow, is built to address it.<\/span><\/font><\/span><div><span><span style=\"font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; text-align: justify;\"><br><\/span><\/span><\/div><div><span><span style=\"font-family: Georgia; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; text-align: justify;\">Your child's report card tells you one thing. Their face on a Sunday evening tells you another. Most parents in Lucknow know what good marks look like. Fewer conversations happen about what good mental health looks like and whether the school their child attends is actively building it, or silently eroding it.<\/span><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-923ccabb-7fff-029a-b43e-29a2af1dcd58\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">But a change has stepped in!&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">This is the conversation that <b><a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/\" target=\"_self\">top CBSE schools in Lucknow<\/a> <\/b>are increasingly having. So, let us get into the details today.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The Numbers That Changed the Conversation<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Student mental health in India isn't a background concern anymore. The evidence has become too significant to set aside.<\/font><\/span><\/p><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" align=\"left\"><table style=\"border: none;\"><colgroup><col width=\"206\"><col width=\"210\"><col width=\"206\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:81.75pt\"><td style=\"border-width: 4.5pt; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(217, 210, 233); padding: 8pt 9pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">74%<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">CBSE students reporting high academic stress&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">(PMC study, Belagavi)<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/td><td style=\"border-width: 4.5pt; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(217, 210, 233); padding: 8pt 9pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">63.5%<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Indian students are stressed due to academic pressure&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">(Deb et al., ResearchGate)<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/td><td style=\"border-width: 4.5pt; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(217, 210, 233); padding: 8pt 9pt; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">50%<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Urban high school students showing signs of anxiety (IJPM)<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\"> A 2023 school-based study across CBSE schools found that 74% of adolescent students reported high levels of academic stress. A separate study of Indian high school students found that 63.5% identified academic pressure as their primary source of stress, and 66% reported feeling pressure from parents to perform better.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">These aren't outlier findings. The WHO has long recommended that schools function as primary mental health support systems. India's own NEP 2020 explicitly commits to student well-being as a core educational outcome. And yet, as research published in School Mental Health in India (2025) notes, mental health support facilities remain absent from most schools across the country.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The gap between what students need and what most schools provide is real. The question for Lucknow parents is: does the school you're choosing understand this, and does it do something about it?<\/font><\/span><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Emotional Well-Being is Not Separate from Academic Excellence<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Many people believe this about schools in India:<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">If a school is academically strong, it must also be stressful. And if children feel relaxed, results may drop.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">But this idea is simply not true. Even the Central Board of Secondary Education recognises that learning and mental well-being go together. Children learn better when they feel safe and confident at school.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Think about it. A stressed child cannot focus well. Their memory suffers, and their attention drops. Problem-solving becomes harder for them. So the anxiety before exams does not help performance. In fact, it often holds students back from doing their best.<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The most academically successful students at India's top institutions are not the ones who were crushed by pressure throughout school. They are the ones who built genuine understanding in an environment that made learning feel safe enough to be curious.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">What Top CBSE Schools in Lucknow Do Differently for Mental Health<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The trusted schools in Lucknow that take student mental health seriously are doing real stuff. They have moved beyond posters on a wall and annual counselling day events. They have built well-being into the structure of daily school life. Here\u2019s how:<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Structured counselling via trained mental health counsellors&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">CBSE's own mental health guidelines call for accessible counselling systems. They must operate continuously. It should not be offered at a time when a student reaches a crisis point. Top CBSE schools in Lucknow that deliver on this have trained counsellors who work proactively. They<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">identify early signs of stress<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">run group workshops on emotional regulation<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">provide one-on-one support before academic difficulties become mental health crises.<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Teachers trained to notice<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Research consistently identifies classroom teachers as the first line of mental health support. Why? Teachers, especially the class teacher, connect with students daily. They see their students every day. Schools that invest in teacher training for emotional awareness produce educators who notice when something is off. It can be<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">the withdrawn student<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">the one whose homework has slipped for weeks<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">the child who laughs too hard at nothing<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">the one who gloomily sits in a corner<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Noticing early changes everything.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Co-curricular activities as a mental health booster<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Activities are not decorative additions to an academic programme. They are evidence-backed interventions. If you are wondering what sports, performing arts, debates, and student leadership programmes do, read ahead.&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">These seemingly simple activities can have a profound impact, such as<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">Sports can help with stress reduction<\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">Winning a debate can 10x self-esteem<\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">Performing arts boost confidence like nothing else<\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">Student leadership programmes help with managing details and developing social belonging<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">A student who has a team to return to after a difficult test has a recovery mechanism. A student who only has marks has only one way to feel worthwhile.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Assessment designed to reduce anxiety<\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Schools that rely exclusively on high-stakes annual examinations are structurally manufacturing anxiety. So, what helps?&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Formative assessment<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: b