-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">A Culture of Safety: DPS Eldeco is a <a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/\" target=\"_self\"><b>trusted school in Lucknow<\/b><\/a> where students speak up because they know they will be heard. That culture is built over the years. This is the most protective factor against student mental health deterioration.<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">For Lucknow families weighing CBSE school fees in Lucknow against the value they receive, this is part of what the investment delivers. We bring a school environment that actively protects the mental health of every child who walks through its gates.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Conclusion<\/font><\/span><\/h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">The top CBSE schools in Lucknow understand that there is not a choice between rigour and well-being, rather building both is a necessity. At DPS Eldeco, that understanding is not a brochure claim. It is the daily practice of every teacher, counsellor, and administrator in our school. We know that a student will only outperform when they feel the 3S:&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Safe<\/font><\/span><\/p><\/li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-varian