yle=\"\">Your Queries Answered<\/font><\/span><\/h2><h3 style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">How do top CBSE schools in Lucknow support student mental health?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Ans - <\/span><font face=\"Georgia\">Top CBSE schools in Lucknow support student mental health through structured counselling programmes, teacher training for emotional awareness, balanced formative assessment, and co-curricular programmes that build resilience and social belonging.&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">Does academic pressure really affect a child's mental health?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Ans - <\/span><font face=\"Georgia\">Yes, significantly. Students often report high academic stress. Chronic stress biologically impacts cognitive functions, memory and attention. Academic performance depends on these heavily.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">What makes DPS Eldeco a trusted school in Lucknow?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Ans - <\/span><font face=\"Georgia\">DPS Eldeco is a trusted school in Lucknow because of how it treats students as whole people. We praise good marks, but we also understand that just good marks are not enough. Additionally, the Delhi Public School Society's institutional standards, when combined with a school culture that prioritises holistic development makes a combo that every student and parent trusts.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">How is emotional well-being built into the CBSE curriculum?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Ans - <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">CBSE formally acknowledges that academic success cannot be separated from mental health. For student well-being in affiliated schools, CBSE include continuous internal assessment to reduce examination anxiety. There are counselling support systems and teacher training in emotional awareness.&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">What sports and activities at DPS Eldeco help students manage mental well-being?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;\">Ans - <\/span><font face=\"Georgia\">At DPS, we integrate Yoga and Meditation, in addition to sports options like cricket, basketball, football, taekwondo and more. These serve as stress-busters and improve mental well-being too.<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\" style=\"\">How can parents support their child\u2019s mental well-being?<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Ans - <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Parents must create a positive mindset wherein there is no unnecessary pressure to score the highest all the time. Positive motivation is always good but being too pushy hampers performance. In addition to this, helping maintain a good sleep schedule and play routine helps too.&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><font face=\"Georgia\">Are teachers trained to support mental health?&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;text-align: justify;margin-top:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Ans - Absolutely! At <b><a href=\"https:\/\/dpseldeco.com\/\" target=\"_self\" style=\"\">top CBSE school<\/a> <\/b>teachers are trained to support mental health. There are counselors who specially look into addressing the pressing concerns of the students.&nbsp;<\/span><\/p><br><br><br><\/span><font face=\"Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; fon