becomes clear.<\/span><\/p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">FAQs<\/span><\/h2><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">1. Is CBSE education good for primary students?<\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Yes, CBSE focuses on concept clarity and overall development, making it ideal for young learners.<\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">2. Are affordable CBSE schools reliable?<\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Many affordable schools provide excellent education, trained teachers, and safe environments.<\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">3. Do primary students need to give entrance exams?<\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Most schools conduct simple interaction sessions instead of exams for young children.<\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">4. How can parents judge a school\u2019s quality?<\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">By visiting the school, meeting teachers, and observing student behavior.<\/span><\/p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">5. What should parents prioritize \u2013 fees or facilities?<\/span><\/h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Parents should look for balance, choosing a school that offers good facilities at reasonable fees.<\/span><\/p><\/span><\/div><\/span>","image_url":"https:\/\/myschool-assets.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com\/dps\/blogs_images\/my11U6nGGnxnkjyT80wpoKWs7Nt0t2O17ddVUvqK.jpg","image_alt_text":"top school in lucknow","last_updated_by":"10050","created_at":"2026-03-16T11:14:22.737000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T11:14:22.737000Z","blog_id":"36","branch_id":"2","school_id":"1","section_order":"1"}],"categories":[],"tag":[{"id":35,"name":"cbse school","description":null,"status":"active","publish_status":"published","sort_order":0,"color":"#667eea","school_id":"1","branch_id":"9","language_id":null,"created_at":"2026-02-18T07:29:18.017000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T05:37:27.293000Z","slug":"cbseschool","pivot":{"blog_id":"36","tag_id":"35"}},{"id":38,"name":"#DPSSchoolLife","description":null,"status":"active","publish_status":"published","sort_order":1,"color":"#667eea","school_id":"1","branch_id":"5","language_id":null,"created_at":"2026-03-14T10:42:36.640000Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T10:42:36.640000Z","slug":"dpsschoollife","pivot":{"blog_id":"36","tag_id":"38"}},{"id":39,"name":"DPS primary school","description":null,"status":"active","publish_status":"published","sort_order":1,"color":"#667eea","school_i